"Iyo modem ihagaritse gusubiza, telefoni yikorera ubwayo mu bucece intambwe "
"zo kugarura: gutangira serivisi ya telefoni bushya, gutangira radiyo bushya, "
"kuzimya no kongera gufungura modem, gutangira firmware bushya no kongera "
"gufungura radiyo yazimijwe. Telefoni ntabwo yigera yongera gutangizwa "
"ubwayo. Niba nta na kimwe gifasha, usabwa kongera gutangiza telefoni. Iyo "
"ibi bizimye, idirishya rya Kugarura Modem rirafunguka aho kugira ngo "
"wikorere intambwe ubwawe."

